{"product_id":"linux-administration-for-dummies","title":"Linux Administration for Dummies","description":"\u003cp\u003eTake the open-source power of Linux to the max with LINUX Administration For Dummies! With up-to-date coverage of the Coda file system, support for SMP and Ipv6, and other new Linux network features, this friendly guide is just what you need to master administration fundamentals, from managing networks to building security into a system.Use the information in LINUX Administration For Dummies to help manage multiple users, configure shared Internet access, set up printers and other network resources, install a security firewall, and troubleshoot common problems.Find administration tools galore on this book's bonus CD-ROM, including open-source versions of Tripware v 1.3.1, Diald v 0.99.1 and v 0.16, and Linuxconf. We've even included freeware versions of WebMin v 0.71, Mon 0.37L, and Sudo 1.5.4.What other book gives you a Web address where you can hear the creator of Linux himself give his favored pronunciation of Linux? From the kernel of Linux basics to ten applications every Linux user needs, LINUX Administration For Dummies is the easy path to mastering Linux!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 191 x 241\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Michael Bellomo | Dummies Technology Press\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780764505898\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 371\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45336435458201,"sku":"Table-A-29780764505898","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/680924dac2f7d_Linux_Programming_For_Dummies_Jim_Keogh.jpg?v=1745599140","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/linux-administration-for-dummies","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}